This project is an independent Microsoft Edge / Chromium Manifest V3 port and
continuation of Nocturne Player:
  Upstream: https://github.com/kvachikk/nocturne-player
  Author:   Vlad Pohorilets
  Baseline: v0.9.1 (commit 0de5804)
  License:  Mozilla Public License Version 2.0 (MPL-2.0)

Major Edge / Chromium MV3 port changes (covered under MPL-2.0):
- Synchronous CustomEvent two-world bridge (`pageagent.js` in world: "MAIN" and
  `content/page/bridge.js` in ISOLATED world), replacing Firefox Xray wrappers.
- Manifest V3 packaging (`src/manifest.mv3.json`) and PNG icon suite.
- SPA YouTube desktop and mobile (`ytm-watch`) chapter extraction.
- Smart auto-hide launcher badge and direct seeked-gated main-video scrubbing.
- Opt-in vertical edge gestures (`layers.dim` overlay dimming with two-way AUTO
  hysteresis and `video.volume` / mute with YouTube host sync).

